🏛️ II. MASTER MATRIX

#	Constitutional Domain	Kernel Invariant	Primary Proof

01	Constitutional supremacy	Actor cannot override constitution	Gate test
02	Identity	Every actor is uniquely attributable	Identity evidence
03	Scope	Authority is spatial/functional bounded	Scope test
04	Mandate	Action requires valid mandate	Mandate test
05	WATERMERK	Authority requires valid watermark	Watermark validation
06	Delegation	Child authority ≤ parent authority	Delegation proof
07	Containment	Authority cannot silently escape boundary	Boundary test
08	Least authority	No unnecessary privilege	Privilege audit
09	Pre-execution validation	Invalid actions never execute	Gate test
10	WISDOM	Security-relevant decisions pass policy intelligence	Decision evidence
11	Evidence	Material actions produce evidence	Evidence test
12	Provenance	Evidence has attributable lineage	Provenance proof
13	Quay	Historical records cannot be silently deleted	Immutability test
14	Auditability	State can be independently inspected	Audit test
15	Transparency	Relevant constitutional state is observable	Observatory proof
16	Challenge	Decisions remain contestable	FOOL test
17	Dissent	Dissent cannot be structurally suppressed	Challenge test
18	Non-sovereignty	No subsystem becomes absolute authority	Authority graph
19	Federation	Membership does not confer authority	Federation test
20	Isolation	Domains cannot cross boundaries implicitly	Isolation proof
21	Temporal integrity	Historical authority is time-bound	Temporal test
22	Revocation	Revocation stops future authority	Revocation test
23	Non-erasure	Revocation cannot erase history	Quay test
24	Succession	New authority requires explicit lineage	Succession proof
25	Evolution	Evolution requires validated transition	Evolution gate
26	Replay	Historical state is reconstructable	Replay test
27	Failure integrity	Missing proof cannot become valid proof	Failure test
28	Delegated locality	Local authority remains bounded	Locality test
29	Pyramid	Each Citadel has ≥1 Pyramid	Structural test
30	L.A.	Reference state remains inspectable	L.A. conformance
31	Historical continuity	Lineage survives version changes	Lineage replay
32	Open Constitution	No actor owns constitutional truth	Challenge/review
33	Constitutional lifecycle	Every consequential state transition is provable	End-to-end proof



