R5-004  Mandate validity
R5-005  Scope containment
R5-006  Parent lineage
R5-007  Temporal validity
R5-008  Evidence integrity
R5-009  Quay append-only property
R5-010  Revocation preservation
R5-011  Succession lineage
R5-012  Historical replay
R5-013  Provenance-gap detection
R5-014  Challenge preservation
R5-015  Independent verification


---

XV. ☄️ THE GOLDEN TEST

De belangrijkste R5-test:

GIVEN
    a historical constitutional action

WHEN
    an independent verifier receives
    the required Quay + Evidence + lineage

THEN
    the verifier SHALL reconstruct:

    actor
    authority
    watermark
    mandate
    scope
    decision
    evidence
    state
    temporal validity

AND

    derive the same constitutional result.

Dat is:

R5-GOLDEN-REPLAY


---

XVI. 🔥 THE ADVERSARIAL GOLDEN TEST

Nog sterker:

GIVEN
    forged watermark
    altered evidence
    broken lineage
    revoked authority
    missing provenance

WHEN
    replay is requested

THEN
    replay SHALL NOT silently succeed.

Expected:

REJECT
or
INCONCLUSIVE

Nooit:

GUESS


---

XVII. 🧠 R5 PROOF RESULT

Een replay-resultaat wordt conceptueel:

ReplayResult
├── action_id
├── historical_state
├── authority_state
├── watermark_state
├── evidence_chain
├── provenance_chain
├── validation_results
├── challenge_state
└── conclusion

Waar conclusion bijvoorbeeld is:

VALID
INVALID
INCONCLUSIVE


