2. ⚓ EVENT ENVELOPE

Alle constitutioneel relevante gebeurtenissen krijgen één canoniek envelope-model:

pub struct ConstitutionalEvent {
    pub event_id: EventId,
    pub event_type: EventType,
    pub schema_version: SchemaVersion,
    pub occurred_at: Timestamp,
    pub recorded_at: Timestamp,

    pub actor: Option<ActorId>,
    pub subject: SubjectId,

    pub watermark_ref: Option<WatermarkId>,
    pub mandate_ref: Option<MandateId>,
    pub evidence_ref: Option<EvidenceId>,
    pub provenance_ref: ProvenanceId,

    pub parent_hash: Option<EventHash>,
    pub payload_hash: PayloadHash,
    pub event_hash: EventHash,

    pub signature: Signature,
}

Het envelope is niet slechts een transportformaat.

Het is een historical commitment.


