22. 🌱 RISK MEMORY

PALACO bewaart:

risk detected
risk assessed
risk response
risk outcome

Daarmee kan BRAINPOWER later onderzoeken:

Which predictions were accurate?
Which were false positives?
Which patterns were repeatedly misleading?

Dat maakt de Risk Engine zelf toetsbaar.


