2. 🧠 FEEDBACK ≠ AUTHORITY

PALACO mag constateren:

"This policy repeatedly produces anomalies."

Maar niet zelfstandig concluderen:

"Therefore I may change the Constitution."

Dus:

FEEDBACK
   ≠
AUTHORITY

en:

LEARNING
   ≠
LEGISLATION


