    pub finding: FeedbackFinding,
    pub confidence: Confidence,
    pub epistemic_status: EpistemicStatus,

    pub provenance_ref: ProvenanceId,
}

Feedback is dus evidence-linked interpretation, geen magische systeemkennis.


