4. 🌱 OUTCOME IS FIRST-CLASS

R6.8 kende execution.

R6.9 maakt het gevolg expliciet:

ACTION
   ↓
OUTCOME

Bijvoorbeeld:

Expected:
Infrastructure restored

Observed:
Infrastructure restored
+ unexpected secondary effect

De outcome moet beide registreren.


---

5. 🧭 EXPECTED VS OBSERVED

Iedere material action kan twee state representations hebben:

EXPECTED_OUTCOME
OBSERVED_OUTCOME

Daaruit:

EXPECTED
     ↓
COMPARISON
     ↓
OBSERVED

Resultaat:

MATCH
DEVIATION
PARTIAL
UNKNOWN


