SOURCE EVENTS
      ↓
OUTCOMES
      ↓
CORRELATIONS
      ↓
FINDING
      ↓
RECOMMENDATION

En kan vaststellen:

SUPPORTED
PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED
UNSUPPORTED
INCONCLUSIVE


