FEEDBACK.CREATED
CORRECTION.PROPOSED
CORRECTION.CHALLENGED
CORRECTION.VERIFIED
CORRECTION.ACCEPTED
CORRECTION.APPLIED
CORRECTION.REJECTED
CORRECTION.SUPERSEDED

Daarmee ontstaat:

OLD STATE
   ↓
PROBLEM DISCOVERED
   ↓
PROPOSAL
   ↓
REVIEW
   ↓
NEW STATE

De oude state blijft bestaan.


