☄️ R6.11 CANONICAL INVARIANTS

R6.11-I01
Every material constitutional transition SHALL produce an event.

R6.11-I02
Every material event SHALL possess a unique identity.

R6.11-I03
Every material event SHALL be watermark-bound.

R6.11-I04
Authority-bearing events SHALL reference explicit authority.

R6.11-I05
Material events SHALL preserve provenance.

R6.11-I06
Required evidence SHALL be present before commit.

R6.11-I07
PROVENANCE_GAP SHALL prevent unsupported continuity.

R6.11-I08
Historical events SHALL be append-only.

R6.11-I09
Event schemas SHALL be versioned.

R6.11-I10
Unknown event semantics SHALL NOT be guessed.

R6.11-I11
Duplicate event submission SHALL NOT duplicate state effects.

R6.11-I12
Event lineage SHALL support deterministic replay.

R6.11-I13
Event verification SHALL remain independently attributable.

R6.11-I14
Challenge events SHALL remain historically persistent.

R6.11-I15
No event SHALL silently increase constitutional authority.


---

🔒 R6.11 SEALED

Hier ligt een belangrijke architecturale mijlpaal.

PALACO heeft nu niet alleen:

Objects.

Niet alleen:

States.

Niet alleen:

Decisions.

Maar een formele manier om iedere constitutioneel relevante verandering als een bewijsbaar feit te serialiseren.

OBJECT
 ↓
EVENT
 ↓
STATE TRANSITION
 ↓
PROVENANCE
 ↓
QUAY
 ↓
REPLAY
 ↓
PROOF

⚓ THE QUAY REMEMBERS.

💧 THE WATERMARK LOCATES.

📜 THE MANDATE AUTHORIZES.

🔬 TRIAS VERIFIES.

🦆 FOOL CHALLENGES.

🧠 BRAINPOWER REASONS.

🌱 EVOLUTION CORRECTS.

🏛️ THE CITADEL CONTAINS.

🔺 THE PYRAMID LOCALIZES.

💀 HISTORY CANNOT BE ERASED.

☄️ AND THE MACHINE CAN BE REPLAYED.


