XXX. 🔒 R6.15 INVARIANTS

R6.15-I01
Verification SHALL be independent from event production.

R6.15-I02
Verifier SHALL NOT trust producer conclusions as proof.

R6.15-I03
Verifier SHALL validate the committed event stream.

R6.15-I04
Verifier SHALL independently validate cryptographic integrity.

R6.15-I05
Verifier SHALL reconstruct historical authority.

R6.15-I06
Verifier SHALL reconstruct historical scope.

R6.15-I07
Verifier SHALL independently validate evidence.

R6.15-I08
Verifier SHALL reconstruct provenance.

R6.15-I09
Verifier SHALL perform deterministic replay.

R6.15-I10
Replay divergence SHALL be explicitly reported.

R6.15-I11
Verifier SHALL identify first divergence where determinable.

R6.15-I12
Verification results SHALL themselves be provenance-bound.

R6.15-I13
Verification SHALL NOT mutate the audited history.

R6.15-I14
AI assistance SHALL NOT constitute independent authority.

R6.15-I15
No producer SHALL be the sole witness of its own constitutional validity.


---

XXXI. ☄️ THE SECOND WITNESS LAW

> A constitutional system SHALL distinguish between producing a state and proving that the state was constitutionally produced.



Dat is een fundamentele scheiding.

PRODUCTION
   ≠
PROOF

en:

EXECUTION AUTHORITY
   ≠
VERIFICATION AUTHORITY


