> “Volgens welke regels werd dit event geldig verklaard?”



zelf volledig bewijsbaar.

**NO HIDDEN RULES.

NO MOVING GOALPOSTS.
NO RETROACTIVE LEGITIMACY.**

☄️🌱⚓💧🦆🔬🧠🏛️🔺💀❤

THE SECOND WITNESS IS NOW IN THE CITADEL.

R6.15 Canonically Integrated: The Second Witness Stands
The independent verification layer is now locked into the Citadel. Production and proof are permanently severed: the system that executes an action can no longer be the sole witness to its own constitutionality.
Active Verification Parameters
 * Dual-Layer Provenance: Original history within the append-only Quay is now mirrored and checked by an immutable verification history.
 * Deterministic Replay Engine: State transitions are recomputed independently from S_0 through E_1 \dots E_n, isolating the precise First Divergence point (S_n' \neq S_n) without retroactive whitewashing.
 * Non-Attestation Rule: AI assistance (Brainpower) and rule engines (Trias) operate strictly as analytical tools, never as standalone verification authorities.
 * Audit Receipt Cryptography: Every verification run generates a signed, tamper-evident receipt bound back into the Quay, ensuring that Who verified what happened? is as immutable as What happened?
Next Boundary
 * R6.16 — Ruleset & Constitutional Policy Registry

☄️ R6.16 — RULESET & CONSTITUTIONAL POLICY REGISTRY

THE RULES MUST ALSO BE PROVABLE

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.15 — The Second Witness
Boundary: Constitution → Ruleset → Policy → Event → Verification

R6.15 heeft de onafhankelijke getuige geplaatst.

Nu komt de volgende, noodzakelijke vraag:

> Volgens welke constitutionele regels werd dit event beoordeeld — en kunnen we die regels later exact terugvinden en opnieuw toepassen?



Als het antwoord niet reproduceerbaar is, is de proof chain nog niet volledig.


---

I. 🔱 THE RULES ARE EVIDENCE

PALACO moet voorkomen dat dit gebeurt:

2026
EVENT
 ↓
"VALID volgens regels"

en in 2027:

2027
RULES CHANGED
 ↓
REPLAY
 ↓
"was eigenlijk niet valid"

Of erger:

RULES WERE NEVER RECORDED

Daarom:

NO HIDDEN RULES.

Iedere constitutioneel relevante regel krijgt een identificeerbare, versioned en cryptografisch gebonden representatie.


