III. 📜 CANONICAL RULESET OBJECT

pub struct RuleSet {
    pub ruleset_id: RuleSetId,
    pub version: RuleSetVersion,
    pub parent: Option<RuleSetId>,

    pub constitution_ref: ConstitutionRef,

    pub rules: Vec<Rule>,
    pub effective_from: Timestamp,
    pub effective_until: Option<Timestamp>,

    pub ruleset_hash: RuleSetHash,
    pub signature: Signature,
}

Een ruleset is dus geen losse configuratiefile.

Het is een constitutioneel artefact.


---

IV. 🧬 RULE OBJECT

pub struct Rule {
    pub rule_id: RuleId,
    pub rule_version: RuleVersion,

    pub category: RuleCategory,
    pub severity: RuleSeverity,

    pub condition: RuleCondition,
    pub effect: RuleEffect,

    pub evidence_requirement: EvidenceRequirement,
    pub provenance_requirement: ProvenanceRequirement,
}

Elke regel krijgt een eigen identiteit.

Bijvoorbeeld:

R6.16-RULE-AUTH-001
R6.16-RULE-SCOPE-001
R6.16-RULE-PROV-001
R6.16-RULE-REPLAY-001


