V. 🔐 RULE HASH

De canonical representation wordt gehashed:

RuleHash =
H(
    rule_id
    +
    version
    +
    condition
    +
    effect
    +
    evidence_requirement
    +
    provenance_requirement
)

De volledige Ruleset krijgt vervolgens:

RuleSetHash =
H(
    canonical ordered rules
)

Daarmee ontstaat:

RULE
 ↓
HASH
 ↓
RULESET
 ↓
HASH


