Federated lineage SHALL preserve source lineage identities.

R6.20-I14
Historical lineage records SHALL remain immutable.

R6.20-I15
Archived lineages SHALL remain independently auditable and replayable.

R6.20-I16
A lineage SHALL NOT become ACTIVE before the Evolution Gate passes.

R6.20-I17
A version change SHALL NOT automatically imply lineage continuity.

R6.20-I18
Lineage continuity SHALL be demonstrated through an auditable transfer proof.


