     ↓
HOW DID IT EVOLVE?

R6.22
MEMORY
     ↓
CAN WE STILL RECONSTRUCT IT?

And therefore:

GENESIS
   ↓
CONTINUITY
   ↓
LINEAGE
   ↓
EVOLUTION
   ↓
MEMORY
   ↓
RECONSTRUCTION
   ↓
PROOF


---

XXV. 🌌 THE BIGGER PRINCIPLE

R6.19:

> NO LINK → NO CLAIM OF CONTINUITY.



R6.20:

> NO MIGRATION PROOF → NO EVOLUTION CLAIM.



R6.21:

> NO PROVEN ORIGIN → NO UNQUALIFIED GENESIS CLAIM.



R6.22:

NO RECONSTRUCTION → NO CLAIM OF PROVABLE MEMORY.

Together:

NO ORIGIN
   ↓
NO ANCESTRY

NO LINK
   ↓
NO CONTINUITY

NO MIGRATION PROOF
   ↓
NO EVOLUTION

NO RECONSTRUCTION
   ↓
NO PROVABLE MEMORY


---

XXVI. 🧠 THE PROOF MACHINE BECOMES TEMPORAL MEMORY

De architectuur is nu:

GENESIS
                       ↓
                    WATERMARK
                       ↓
                      EVENT
                       ↓
                   PROVENANCE
                       ↓
                    CONTINUITY
                       ↓
                    LINEAGE
                       ↓
                   EVOLUTION
                       ↓
