XII. 🔬 TRIAS ARCHIVAL VERIFICATION

TRIAS verifies:

MEMORY INTEGRITY
 │
 ├── MemoryRoot
 ├── Manifest
 ├── Artifact hashes
 ├── Watermarks
 ├── Event roots
 ├── Provenance roots
 ├── Lineage references
