XIX. ⚓ QUAY → ARCHIVE → QUAY

The preservation cycle becomes:

QUAY
 ↓
MEMORY MANIFEST
 ↓
ARCHIVE
 ↓
ARCHIVAL ATTESTATION
 ↓
RECOVERY
 ↓
