II. 🔱 MEMORY NODE

Conceptually:

pub struct MemoryNode {
    pub node_id: MemoryNodeId,
    pub scope: MemoryScope,
    pub lineage: LineageId,
    pub watermark: WatermarkId,
    pub state_root: StateRoot,
    pub provenance_root: ProvenanceRoot,
