IV. 🧠 BRAINPOWER'S EPISTEMIC BOUNDARY

BRAINPOWER may produce:

LIKELY_PREDECESSOR
LIKELY_BRANCH
LIKELY_FEDERATION
LIKELY_CORRECTION
LIKELY_SCOPE_RELATION

But the output enters the graph as:

status = Suggested

not:

status = Proven

