CLAIM
 ↓
SUGGESTION
 ↓
EVIDENCE
 ↓
VERIFICATION
 ↓
PROVEN
 ↓
CHALLENGE
 ↓
REASSESSMENT

This creates:

A LINEAGE OF KNOWLEDGE, NOT ONLY A LINEAGE OF STATES.

That is a major extension of R6.


---

