XXIV. 🧠 THE THREE-LAYER TRUTH MODEL

PALACO kan vanaf hier drie verschillende vragen beantwoorden:

Layer 1 — Historical

WHAT HAPPENED?

Layer 2 — Evidentiary

WHAT CAN BE PROVEN?

Layer 3 — Epistemic

WHAT DOES PALACO CURRENTLY RECOGNIZE
AS ESTABLISHED?

Daarboven staat nog:

