WHAT MAY THE SYSTEM ACT UPON?

En dat levert:

HISTORY
  ↓
EVIDENCE
  ↓
KNOWLEDGE
  ↓
AUTHORITY
  ↓
ACTION

Geen enkele laag mag stilzwijgend voor een andere worden aangezien.


---

XXV. 🔥 THE BIG PRINCIPLE

R6.26 zei:

> No edge → no relationship.



R6.27 voegt toe:

> No epistemic status → no reliable interpretation of the relationship.



Dus:

🌱 NO STATUS → NO CLAIM OF KNOWLEDGE.

🦆 NO CHALLENGE PATH → NO UNQUESTIONED CERTAINTY.

🧠 NO INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION → NO AI PROMOTION TO PROOF.

🔬 NO REPLAY → NO VERIFIED KNOWLEDGE TRANSITION.

💧 NO WATERMARK → NO TEMPORAL ANCHOR.

⚓ NO QUAY RECORD → NO FORENSIC MEMORY.


---

XXVI. ☄️ R6.27 SEALED

De Proof Machine heeft nu drie fundamentele objectlagen:

STATE
               ↓
            WATERMARK
               ↓
          MEMORY NODE
               ↓
          MEMORY EDGE
               ↓
      EPISTEMIC RELATION
               ↓
            EVIDENCE
               ↓
