XXII. ☄️ THE BIG PRINCIPLE

The new canonical rule:

PALACO SHALL NEVER EXTEND A PROOF BEYOND THE BOUNDARY OF ITS EVIDENCE.

Or, more brutally:

💧 NO EVIDENCE → NO PROOF.

🔬 NO CLOSED OBLIGATION → NO CLOSURE.

🦆 NO CHALLENGE RESOLUTION → NO FINALITY.

🧠 NO INFERENCE → NO FABRICATED CERTAINTY.

🌳 NO HISTORY ERASURE → NO RETROACTIVE KNOWLEDGE.

⚓ NO QUAY RECORD → NO FORENSIC CLAIM.


