XXIII. 🔒 R6.28 SEALED

The Proof Machine now has a precise epistemic geometry:

REALITY
                       │
                       ▼
                  EVENTS
                       │
                       ▼
                   MEMORY
                       │
                       ▼
                  WATERMARK
                       │
                       ▼
