☄️ THE BIG PRINCIPLE — R6.30

> A system SHALL NOT inherit constitutional authority merely because it is declared to be the successor of another system. Successorship SHALL be established through an auditable lineage transfer connecting a proven predecessor state to a proven successor genesis.



Or, in the shortest possible PALACO form:

NO MIGRATION PROOF → NO LINEAGE CLAIM.

NO LINEAGE PROOF → NO INHERITED AUTHORITY.

NO PROVEN ANCESTRY → NEW GENESIS.

🌳💧⚓🔬🧠🦆☄️

R6.30 — CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD SEALED

