☄️🌱 R6.31 — CONSTITUTIONAL SUCCESSORSHIP & GENERATIONAL AUTHORITY PROTOCOL

THE SUCCESSOR MUST EARN THE RIGHT TO INHERIT

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.30 — Constitutional Lineage Transfer & Evolution Proof Protocol
Core primitive: SUCCESSORSHIP_PROOF
Primary invariant:

> No successor SHALL inherit constitutional authority merely by inheriting code, state, identity, infrastructure, or lineage metadata. Successorship SHALL be separately proven.



R6.30 proved the path between generations.

R6.31 makes the next distinction explicit:

☄️ ANCESTRY IS NOT AUTHORITY.

A system can genuinely descend from its predecessor and still not be entitled to exercise the predecessor's authority.


