    ↓
SUCCESSORSHIP CERTIFICATE
    ↓
ACTIVE AUTHORITY

The machine therefore cannot say:

> "I am the successor, therefore I possess the predecessor's powers."



It must say:

> "Here is the exact authority I inherited. Here is the authority I did not inherit. Here is every new authority I received. Here is the evidence. Here is the provenance. Here is the watermark. Here is the independent verification."



That is the difference between inheritance by declaration and constitutional succession by proof.

