VIII. 💀 NO PRIVILEGE AMPLIFICATION

The following transition is forbidden:

OLD AUTHORITY
     ↓
MIGRATION
     ↓
BROADER AUTHORITY

unless the expansion has an independent constitutional origin.

Therefore:

MIGRATION SHALL NOT AMPLIFY PRIVILEGE.

Migration can:

preserve
reduce
transform
retire
split
rebind

but cannot silently:

escalate


