> No constitutional authority SHALL cross a lineage boundary without an explicit determination of which mandates, duties, constraints, liabilities, and accountability obligations accompany it.



R6.31 established:

> Ancestry is not authority.



R6.32 established:

> Transferred authority is not automatically executable.



R6.33 now closes the complementary gap:

☄️ POWER WITHOUT RESPONSIBILITY SHALL NEVER BE AN IMPLICIT MIGRATION RESULT.


