PRESERVE EVIDENCE
RESPECT LIMITS
ANSWER TO REVIEW
HONOR PREVIOUS ADJUDICATION
PROTECT SUBJECTS
MAINTAIN TRACEABILITY

If the successor receives only:

POWER

while discarding:

DUTY

