II. ⚖️ THE MANDATE TRIAD

Every constitutional authority is evaluated as:

AUTHORITY
          /   \
         /     \
        ↓       ↓
    MANDATE   OBLIGATION
         \     /
          \   /
           ↓
       ACCOUNTABILITY

These are related, but not identical.

Authority

What may be done.

Mandate

Why it may be done.

Obligation

What must be done.

Accountability

What must remain demonstrable.

Therefore:

CAN
≠
MAY
≠
MUST

This distinction becomes canonical.


