NEW LINEAGE ≠ CLEAN SLATE

NEW WATERMARK ≠ ERASURE

NEW CODE ≠ NEW HISTORY

NEW CONSTITUTION ≠ AUTOMATIC FORGIVENESS

And:

CORRECTION ≠ ERASURE OF FAILURE


