R6.36-I22
A reopening outcome SHALL be evidence-bound.

R6.36-I23
A new finality SHALL have its own provenance chain.

R6.36-I24
The historical record SHALL distinguish original finality from subsequent reopening.

R6.36-I25
New proof SHALL be capable of changing current constitutional effect without rewriting historical fact.


