☄️🌱 R6.38 — CONSTITUTIONAL DOCTRINE & PRINCIPLE EVOLUTION PROTOCOL

THE PATTERN MAY BE DISCOVERED — THE PRINCIPLE MUST BE PROVEN

Status: 🔒 CANONICAL ENGINEERING BUILD
Parent: R6.37 — Constitutional Precedent & Historical Authority Protocol
Core primitive: CONSTITUTIONAL_DOCTRINE
Secondary primitive: PRINCIPLE_EVOLUTION

