III. 🚫 THE ANTI-FREQUENCY RULE

PALACO explicitly rejects:

10 decisions → doctrine
100 decisions → stronger doctrine
1,000 decisions → constitutional truth

Frequency is evidence of recurrence.

It is not automatically evidence of authority.

Therefore:

NO MAJORITY-OF-PRECEDENTS RULE.

A thousand decisions cannot manufacture constitutional authority if their source authority is defective.


