IV. 🔱 DOCTRINE OBJECT

Conceptually:

pub struct ConstitutionalDoctrine {
    pub doctrine_id: DoctrineId,
    pub principle_id: PrincipleId,
    pub source_precedents: Vec<PrecedentId>,
    pub constitutional_basis: ConstitutionalBasisId,
    pub jurisdiction: JurisdictionId,
    pub scope: DoctrineScope,
    pub force: DoctrineForce,
    pub provenance_root: ProvenanceRoot,
    pub evidence_root: EvidenceRoot,
    pub status: DoctrineStatus,
    pub created_at: Timestamp,
    pub watermark_id: WatermarkId,
    pub signature: Signature,
}

The doctrine must therefore identify:

WHAT principle?
FROM WHICH precedents?
UNDER WHICH constitution?
WITH WHAT scope?
WITH WHAT force?
PROVEN BY WHICH evidence?
WHEN recognized?


