V. 🌳 PRINCIPLE OBJECT

A doctrine should not merely be a collection of cases.

It should expose the principle it claims to represent.

Conceptually:

pub struct ConstitutionalPrinciple {
    pub principle_id: PrincipleId,
    pub statement: PrincipleStatement,
    pub constitutional_basis: ConstitutionalBasisId,
    pub supporting_evidence: EvidenceRoot,
    pub supporting_precedents: Vec<PrecedentId>,
    pub limitations: Vec<PrincipleLimitation>,
    pub jurisdiction: JurisdictionId,
    pub watermark_id: WatermarkId,
}

