when the requested meaning remains within the constitutional semantic and normative boundary.

AMBIGUOUS

when multiple interpretations remain constitutionally plausible.

CONFLICTED

when authorities or provisions genuinely collide.

AMENDMENT_REQUIRED

when the requested outcome cannot be constitutionally derived without changing the governing text or foundational meaning.

UNPROVEN

when the evidentiary basis is insufficient.

This prevents a dangerous binary:

yes / no

from hiding uncertainty.


